   "source": [
    "## Variables\n",
    "\n",
    "- Variables store memory in for the value.\n",
    "- Variable names can be created with A-Z,a-z,0-9 and _.\n",
    "- No special characters are allowed.\n",
    "- A variable should always start with a character or _.\n",
    "- It cannot start with a number.\n",
    "- Spaces are not allowed in variable naming."
   ]
